{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11233060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11233060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1123306001:1":{"text":"もう回収が終わったのか？この薬が完成したら、これを加えて……","source_cn":"这么快就收好了？等我做完这些药。加上这味——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478F5E884AD7D680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123306002:1":{"text":"割合は……よし、これでいい。","source_cn":"比例是……这样就可以了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC503C77AA367FB1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123306003:1":{"text":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","source_cn":"这些药材，魔法师也会用得上的，就算是刚才的酬劳吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63D245D8F5EF5BF9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","female":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","variant_male_record_index":"127642","variant_female_record_index":"127643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1123306003":{"text":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","source_cn":"这些药材，魔法师也会用得上的，就算是刚才的酬劳吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63D245D8F5EF5BF9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","female":"この薬はメイジも使うものじゃ。さっきの報酬に取っておけ。","variant_male_record_index":"127642","variant_female_record_index":"127643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123306004:1":{"text":"大部分は傷薬を作るのに使う。","source_cn":"大部分会做成伤药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B19DD4A5C226C4